  "body": "Hi,\r\nI made all settings as wrote here https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy/blob/master/docs/configuring-playbook-federation.md. Of course I added DNS record  for _matrix._tcp.my.domain\r\nBut have error \r\n\r\n> Non-200 response 404 from remote serverNon-200 response 404 from remote server\r\n\r\nAnd actually in nginx log I see 404 error\r\n\r\n> GET /_matrix/federation/v1/version HTTP/1.1\" 404 125 \"-\" \"Go-http-client/1.1\" \"94.237.61.73\r\n\r\nAt the same time if I open URL \r\n\r\n> /_matrix/federation/v1/version\r\n\r\nfrom my mobile I see \r\n\r\n>{\"server\":{\"name\":\"Synapse\",\"version\":\"1.66.0\"}}\r\n\r\nAnd in nginx log everything OK too\r\n\r\n> GET /_matrix/federation/v1/version HTTP/1.1\" 200 76 \"-\" \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:102.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/102.0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
